# Named modules, not mod.rs

A module lives in its named file beside its directory. Never add `mod.rs`.

```
src/kafka/catalog.rs
src/kafka/catalog/snapshot.rs
```

```
# ❌ BAD
src/kafka/catalog/mod.rs
```
